# Environment for chainchit-keeper.service (systemd EnvironmentFile format:
# plain KEY=value, no quotes, no `export`). Install a copy at
#   ~/.config/chainchit-keeper.env   and  chmod 600  it.
#
# The keeper still reads frontend/.env.local for contract IDs + network, so the
# ONLY hard requirement here is the signing key. Any var set here OVERRIDES the
# same var in .env.local (real process env wins in keeper's loader).

# --- required -------------------------------------------------------------
# Admin/keeper signing key. Must be the group admin to start_collection /
# advance_cycle. Payout execution is permissionless and works with any funded key.
SOROBAN_SECRET_KEY=S_REPLACEME_WITH_YOUR_ADMIN_SECRET

# --- optional overrides (uncomment to change dwell windows / targeting) ----
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NETWORK=TESTNET
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FACTORY_CONTRACT=CAYOIBPQO4QK6Q3YD4OYDMFRV4BLFZMQ3NVFUB522VHVC62ZPT5OXUBB
# GROUPS=                          # comma list; bypasses factory discovery
# GROUPS_SKIP=                     # comma list of group ids to IGNORE even if the
#                                  # factory hands them back to the keeper. Use this
#                                  # for deliberately-unfunded cohorts (e.g. the
#                                  # join-only demo groups) so the keeper never
#                                  # start_collection's them into a Collecting stall.
# Throwaway validation groups from the 2026-09-22 deadline live-test (see
# docs/USERS.md "Live Validation"). Testnet resets wipe them eventually, so this
# is a convenience example, not a permanent list:
# GROUPS_SKIP=CANT5OHCF3APTVDLN2S4MH3IBM3NZC5AVTCENDCGVJBYAB4LK3ODIB3D,CDKGTN5JWATHX6BZL3NTWUA7X3OJZBBYC62HWHEZPLVRR3EHHR32OGMC,CBZNWRL7H5VANLW45V2BLMZMHLSYJR5NGEFIZ3S4VZXTJZ35PATSM4NY
# JOIN_GRACE_MINUTES=30
# COLLECTION_WINDOW_HOURS=48       # only a fallback for LEGACY groups that predate
#                                  # the on-chain collection deadline; live groups
#                                  # now force-advance via begin_bidding_after_deadline
#                                  # once the contract's own deadline passes.
# BIDDING_WINDOW_HOURS=12
# PAYOUT_COOLDOWN_MINUTES=10
